   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a product of \\( 2^{x} \\) and \\( \\cos^{3}(2x) \\), so the product rule comes first: \\( f'(x) = \\left(2^{x}\\right)'\\,\\cos^{3}(2x) + 2^{x}\\left(\\cos^{3}(2x)\\right)' \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Multiply",
            [
               "Power",
               2,
               "x"
            ],
            [
               "Power",
               [
                  "Cos",
                  [
                     "Multiply",
